{"id":"a4e4c2a64d134dae7341f716bebc0c66996007a3","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1238738","title":"六年前端 27 岁被裁了坐标成都，投了一个月简历石沉大海，准备转后端全栈了，转 go 还是 Java 还是去搞 Python agent","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"BigPiggggg","excerpt":"职场话题 - @BigPiggggg - 6 年前端投了一个月简历，三个面试，另外两家挂了，有一家一二面都过了，下午 hr 打电话准备和我谈薪，结果因为我的第一学历直接把我拒了😥（我是自考本科），目前 boss 已经刷不到新的岗位了要么是打过","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Wrapper\">\n                \n                \n<div><p>6 年前端投了一个月简历，三个面试，另外两家挂了，有一家一二面都过了，下午 hr 打电话准备和我谈薪，结果因为我的第一学历直接把我拒了😥（我是自考本科），目前 boss 已经刷不到新的岗位了要么是打过招呼的要么是僵尸岗位。</p><p>我只打算在成都或者重庆工作，现在非常迷茫，我有一点 node 服务端（ nest ）的经验。打算往全栈方向转型，现在在纠结是转 Go 还是 Java 还是 Python Agent ，咨询了一下学习周期都差不多大概是 3 个月左右，最近特别焦虑，求各位老哥给点建议。</p></div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n\n\n<div>\n    <div><P><a href=\"/tag/成都\"><li></li> 成都</a><a href=\"/tag/全栈\"><li></li> 全栈</a><a href=\"/tag/后端\"><li></li> 后端</a></P><p><span>64 replies &#160;<strong>•</strong> &#160;2026-09-02 16:09:40 +08:00</span>\n    </p></div>\n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18040105\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/4044fb187f7c65963af80c14d883cd0d?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"AutumnVerse\" data-uid=\"345052\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/AutumnVerse\">AutumnVerse</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-01 19:55:36 +08:00\">20h 27m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>首先排除 node 服务端，我想不出来哪里有公司招这个</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18040112\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/4044fb187f7c65963af80c14d883cd0d?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"AutumnVerse\" data-uid=\"345052\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>2</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/AutumnVerse\">AutumnVerse</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-01 19:58:42 +08:00\">20h 24m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>java python go 里面，我觉得选 go 靠谱点</p><p>三个月学 go 完全可以上手项目。<br>三个月学 java vo do dto 都没搞明白<br>三个月学 python ，各种花里胡哨的魔术方法都看不懂</p><p>Python agent ，重要的是 agent ，跟语言没啥关系</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18040114\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/733a/b6d9/175519_normal.png?m=1779633270\" alt=\"coderfee\" data-uid=\"175519\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/coderfee\">coderfee</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-01 20:00:10 +08:00\">20h 23m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>哪个职位多搞哪个</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18040120\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/56c51007330840bea223cbcb36203a38?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"ashuai\" data-uid=\"9636\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>6</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ashuai\">ashuai</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-01 20:02:04 +08:00\">20h 21m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>转 AI ，你说的 go/java/python 你想学什么？你出活有 AI 快吗？？</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18040126\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/beb8/0da5/363794_normal.png?m=1767592418\" alt=\"taqingqiu\" data-uid=\"363794\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>7</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/taqingqiu\">taqingqiu</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-01 20:05:35 +08:00\">20h 17m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>很多语言我都不会，有 AI 只要指导他工作就可以</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18040127\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/063a/2a6f/259411_normal.png?m=1751099173\" alt=\"version\" data-uid=\"259411\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/version\">version</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-01 20:06:09 +08:00\">20h 17m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>转啥都没用。面试官又不是啥子。没经验招来干嘛。都问 ai 生成不经验决策就是 屎 s 代码呢。。实际上就是 hr 打电话让你降薪..太贵选了另外候选人</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18040172\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/d8e51354c80f463d450612e736f8573e?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"MAVETRICK\" data-uid=\"594960\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>14</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/MAVETRICK\">MAVETRICK</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-01 20:19:18 +08:00\">20h 4m ago via iPhone</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <p>都用 ai 等于都没用，这行目前的问题是整个行业要被一锅端的问题，转啥其实都没用。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18040204\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/0bb4/7650/701218_normal.png?m=1788260272\" alt=\"BigPiggggg\" data-uid=\"701218\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>19</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/BigPiggggg\">BigPiggggg</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-01 20:37:01 +08:00\">19h 46m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/version\">version</a> 一言难尽，二面主管面的时候结束的时候还和我说一面技术面对我评价很高，我还以为稳了，然后结束后下午 hr 就打过来找了解上一家的情况，然后问了下我的基本情况，我如实说了，他沉默了一下告诉我 那不合适了 <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/YGIx7lh.png\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/YGIx7lh.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a>，本来这些初筛的时候就很明显能够看出来的，搞不懂。。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18040228\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/0bb4/7650/701218_normal.png?m=1788260272\" alt=\"BigPiggggg\" data-uid=\"701218\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>21</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/BigPiggggg\">BigPiggggg</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-01 20:47:36 +08:00\">19h 35m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/9526666\">9526666</a> java 岗位多但是人也太多了，Python ai 应用好像只有年初的时候岗位很多，go 的话人不多岗位也不多，所以现在非常纠结</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18040250\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9000/a5e7/398207_normal.png?m=1756976085\" alt=\"VoiceEXONE\" data-uid=\"398207\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>22</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/VoiceEXONE\">VoiceEXONE</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-01 20:59:36 +08:00\">19h 23m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>都全栈了还有必要选嘛😂🤔</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18040269\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/4a1a/88e6/494415_normal.png?m=1675737379\" alt=\"SanjinGG\" data-uid=\"494415\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>23</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/SanjinGG\">SanjinGG</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-01 21:08:35 +08:00\">19h 14m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>直接 vibe 一个项目开始投啊 真等学完 3 个月再投。黄花菜都凉了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18040337\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/217c4134e1eb90183a637bf0874b0a2b?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"dxcqcv\" data-uid=\"4692\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>24</sp